  references/sound-and-mix.md and README.md describe and use the same target (-14 LUFS / -1.5 dBTP stays available as a setting).
- package.json and .claude-plugin/plugin.json version 0.3.0.

Added by By Mel Ross in 0.4.0 (November 2026), in skills/3-editing/reel-editor.
- Clip finder: scripts/find_clips.py and references/find-clips.md rank 30-60 s moments of one long recording from its transcript
  (hook, standalone, value, energy, platform fit) and set up one reel folder per chosen clip, with tests in
  tests/reel-clips.test.mjs. Written from scratch; the general idea of transcript-first clip ranking is common to many clipping
  tools and no code or text from another project was copied.
- Reel editor page: review/editor-server.mjs, review/editor-core.mjs, review/editor.html and references/editor-page.md (a local, phone-friendly
  page: caption word fixes, keep/drop cut pieces with exact retiming, pills/stickers/sounds on and off, GIF/graphic/photo popups, text in
  front of or behind the speaker, a Re-render button that runs the existing cut/render/QA steps, timestamped backups and Undo), a "popup"
  card type, "off" on cards and sound events and brand.json "text_default" in scripts/build_reel.py, and tests/reel-editor-page.test.mjs.
  Written from scratch in plain Node and vanilla JavaScript; no new dependencies.
- package.json and .claude-plugin/plugin.json version 0.4.0.

Added by By Mel Ross in 0.5.0 (November 2026), in skills/3-editing/reel-editor unless a path says otherwise.
- Style Menu: references/style-menu.md and assets/style-menu.json (19 looks called by ID: hooks H1-H5, captions C1-C5, layouts L1-L9, each
  with its status and the setting or card that produces it); new card types "polaroids", "xlist", "stat" and "tiles", a "caption" and a soft
