  Python and HTML/CSS/GSAP like the rest of build_reel.py; no new dependencies.
- Handwriting font: assets/fonts/Caveat-700-latin.woff2, the Latin subset of Caveat Bold as served by Google Fonts, with its SIL Open Font
  License 1.1 text in assets/fonts/OFL-Caveat.txt (Copyright 2014 The Caveat Project Authors, https://github.com/googlefonts/caveat).
- Word list: brand.json "vocabulary" (terms, a Whisper prompt and corrections of mishearings), applied to captions by scripts/auto_edit.py;
